WEBVTT

00:08:29.265 --> 00:08:32.200
I wrote her little love notes

00:08:32.224 --> 00:08:35.020
for her and for all the other
queer kids of color

00:08:35.044 --> 00:08:36.890
trying to be magnificent.

00:08:38.437 --> 00:08:40.056
Like, when you lose yourself,

00:08:41.066 --> 00:08:45.319
dig deep into your ancestry,
because you will find the pieces there.

00:08:47.173 --> 00:08:53.715
And also, reminders that soft
is not a pass to duck,

00:08:53.739 --> 00:08:56.421
to hide, to be silent, to cower.

00:08:57.659 --> 00:08:59.884
Soft is also a push

00:08:59.908 --> 00:09:01.598
to hold ourselves accountable.